      "en": "God is our refuge and strength, a very present help in trouble.",
      "ko": "하나님은 우리의 피난처시요 힘이시니 환난 중에 만날 큰 도움이시라",
      "source_text_hash": "c718e973dd14783c1687bc7377dab423bc7ccf94d8d19535d9c90591ff11cde0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f8e9f7844634405d28c3af769c67f25e4f690e6256e476cf06f747256603d6eb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "하나님은 우리의 피난처시요 힘이시니 환난 중에 만날 큰 도움이시라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "f8e9f7844634405d28c3af769c67f25e4f690e6256e476cf06f747256603d6eb"
      ]
