      "en": "The nations raged. The kingdoms were moved. He lifted his voice and the earth melted.",
      "ko": "이방이 훤화하며 왕국이 동하였더니 저가 소리를 발하시매 땅이 녹았도다",
      "source_text_hash": "2294976d01c254f11c39b5d220c284fc1d09e035179e8800d3c618af9041a8f1",
      "translation_text_hash": "4707005c4112051a073b0cec01f42d3dd1207cb2e3c87d9ce5548f25b7cb0329",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
